    "limits": [
      "Documentary admission only; no driver, pairing, route, physical action or automation activation.",
      "The NHA-009 harness is not a production thermostat driver; the raw client remains NO-GO for a real thermostat.",
      "Permissions, format, unit, finite discovered bounds and minStep must be admitted from actual discovery by driver136.",
      "Observed activity must retain domain climate semantics and presence/quality; absent or stale never means idle or zero power.",
